WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:15.836
While Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom were on their honeymoon, we decided to clean the house for them.

2
00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:18.715
Hana: What are you doing, Mommy?

3
00:00:18.716 --> 00:00:21.839
Mom: I want to wash these for Sunny.

4
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.903
Hana: How are you going to wash them all?

5
00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:27.513
Mom: I'm taking them to the Laundromat.

6
00:00:27.514 --> 00:00:30.509
Do you want to come along?

7
00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.046
Hana: This is my first time at a Laundromat.

8
00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:38.306
Mom: Well, we need to find an empty washing machine.

9
00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:41.058
Hana: Here, Mommy!

10
00:00:41.059 --> 00:00:44.702
Mom: Can you change these into coins?

11
00:00:44.703 --> 00:00:48.394
Hana: Can you change these into coins, please?

12
00:00:48.395 --> 00:00:50.107
Woman: Here you go.

13
00:00:50.108 --> 00:00:52.892
Hana: Thank you.

14
00:00:52.893 --> 00:00:55.877
Mom: We'll wash the blankets first.

15
00:00:55.878 --> 00:00:58.883
Hana: They're so heavy!

16
00:00:58.884 --> 00:01:00.408
Mom: Yes, they are.

17
00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:03.874
Now, push the door and turn the dial.

18
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:08.738
Mom: Then we sit here and wait!

19
00:01:08.739 --> 00:01:10.388
Hana: What's that?

20
00:01:10.389 --> 00:01:12.997
Mom: That means the washing is finished.

21
00:01:12.998 --> 00:01:16.020
Help me put it into the dryer, Hana.

22
00:01:16.021 --> 00:01:18.215
Hana: Now, what do we do?

23
00:01:18.216 --> 00:01:21.894
Mom: Do you want some soda?

24
00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:24.392
Hana: What is Bada doing?

25
00:01:24.393 --> 00:01:27.951
Mom: He is helping Sunny's parents clean the house.

26
00:01:27.952 --> 00:01:31.154
Hana: They feel so soft and dry!

27
00:01:31.155 --> 00:01:34.484
Mom: Thanks for helping me, Hana.

28
00:01:34.485 --> 00:01:37.576
Mother: We finished cleaning the house.

29
00:01:37.577 --> 00:01:39.995
Bada: I helped too, Mommy!

30
00:01:39.996 --> 00:01:42.620
Mom: I'm so proud of you, Bada.

31
00:01:42.621 --> 00:01:44.795
And you too, Hana.

32
00:01:44.796 --> 00:01:49.766
Mother: Your children are such hard workers!

33
00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:53.055
Aunt Sunny's house looks so clean!

34
00:01:53.056 --> 00:01:57.972
I can't wait for her and Uncle Tom to come home!
